OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is stopping more freight
OL,4,Amoving from road to rail?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has set a new target to
OL,7,Fincrease the amount of freight going on
OL,8,Ftrains by 40% by 2040.
OL,10,FThe plans have been welcomed by
OL,11,Fcouncils and business leaders in the
OL,12,FEast of England, who say it will be
OL,13,Fgood for the economy and the
OL,14,Fenvironment and tackle congestion on
OL,15,Fbusy roads such as the A14 and A12.
OL,17,FThey would have a big impact in
OL,18,FSuffolk, which has the country's
OL,19,Flargest container port in Felixstowe
OL,20,Fand one of the largest rail freight
OL,21,Fterminals in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
