OL,3,GNEWSAWhat is stopping more freight
OL,4,Amoving from road to rail?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut ministers have been warned that the
OL,7,Fgrowth in rail freight will not happen
OL,8,Funless there is significant investment
OL,9,Fin rail infrastructure.
